22. Collapsible
Collapsible — katta contentni yashirish va bosganda ochish uchun ishlatiladi.
<button data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#demo">
    Collapsible
</button>

<div id="demo" class="collapse">
    Bu yashirin content.
</div>
Link bilan
<a href="#demo" data-toggle="collapse">Open</a>

<div id="demo" class="collapse">
    Bu content.
</div>
.in — boshidan ochiq
<div id="demo" class="collapse in">
    Bu content boshidan ochiq.
</div>
Collapsible Panel
<div class="panel-group">

    <div class="panel panel-default">

        <div class="panel-heading">
            <h4 class="panel-title">
                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#panel1">
                    Collapsible Panel
                </a>
            </h4>
        </div>

        <div id="panel1" class="panel-collapse collapse">
            <div class="panel-body">
                Panel Content
            </div>
            <div class="panel-footer">
                Footer
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>
//KEYWORD
22. Collapsible
→ Katta contentni yashirish/ochish uchun ishlatiladi.
→ .collapse → yashirin content.
→ .in → boshidan ochiq.
→ data-toggle="collapse" → collapse ishga tushadi.
→ data-target / href → button/linkni content bilan bog‘laydi.
→ data-parent → accordionda faqat bittasini ochiq qoldiradi.
→ Accordion → bir nechta collapsible panel.
